At 08:18 PM 06/12/2001 -0400, Invent Yourself wrote:
> > If you want total clarity, use the gismu equivalents of the
> > attitudinals.
>
>Do they all have exact gismu equivalents?

They all have exact brivla equivalents, but we haven't determined what they 
are %^)

(This was intentional - I did not want attitudinals to be polluted by an 
attempt to match  the semantic constraints that would inevitably come from 
equating them to particular brivla.  The idea is to express the emotions 
and not analyze them.  If you want to analyze emotions, you can use selbri.)

I believe that the selbri equivalent of any attitudinal is "melu'ezo[UI]"

